This licence covers the sample source code in the src/ directory and the
verify.ps1 script only.

The files in protected/, decompiled/ and evidence/ are output of the ProofCloak
service. The protected assembly contains ProofCloak runtime code. Those files
are provided for inspection and verification only, and no licence to the
ProofCloak runtime is granted.

